  "body": [
    "Register for Fall Programming! Session runs now - Nov 8.",
    "PLAY PLAY submenu Programs Private Lessons Adult Camps Summer Camps Book a Court Free30 Dave Bailey Programs",
    "EVENTS EVENTS submenu Calendar 2026 BNP Paribas World Team Cup",
    "ABOUT ABOUT submenu Meet Our Team Contact Us Sponsors & Partners USTA National Campus Scholarship",
    "WATCH WATCH submenu Watch Live Record Your Match",
    "VISIT VISIT submenu Hotel Booking Sustainability Health & Wellness Shop",
    "Home >",
    "Play >",
    "Free30",
    "Central Florida residents new to our programs are invited to enjoy a complimentary 30-minute session with one of our certified teaching pros. Whether you're picking up a racquet for the first time or returning to the game, this one-on-one experience is designed to get you started with confidence.",
    "During your session, you'll hit and rally while getting tips and personalized recommendations for classes and programs that match your goals. If you’re looking for gear, they can point you in the right direction at our Pro Shop and help you register for what’s next. For kids, the coach will connect with parents to walk through the best pathway for development and future success. All ages and abilities are welcome.",
    "Our free community drop-in is designed for absolute adult beginners, making it fun and easy to fall in love with tennis.",
    "Learn More",
    "Enjoy free pickleball while meeting other adult players in the community. This is not a coach-led session.",
    "Learn More",
    "Tennis is an excellent way to stay physically fit and mentally sharp. All veterans and service men and women are welcome at no cost.",
    "To register, contact tony.stingley@usta.com.",
    "The program is designed for individuals with physical disabilities who wish to play wheelchair tennis. All players, regardless of level or disability, are welcome. Wheelchairs and racquets are provided, if needed.",
    "Learn More",
    "Download the CourtReserve App",
    "Monday - Friday 7:00 AM - 9:00 PM",
    "Saturday 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM",
    "Sunday 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM",
